rmation From Web"], "prefix": "10.1007", "author": [{"given": "Sunil", "family": "Gupta", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "297", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2024, 8, 10]]}, "container-title": ["Web Scraping with Python"], "language": "en", "link": [{"URL": "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/979-8-8688-0776-3_2", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2024, 8, 9]], "date-time": "2024-08-09T08:23:10Z", "timestamp": 1723191790000}, "score": 49.589878, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://link.springer.com/10.1007/979-8-8688-0776-3_2"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2024]]}, "ISBN": ["9798868807763"], "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1007/979-8-8688-0776-3_2", "published": {"date-parts": [[2024]]}, "assertion": [{"value": "10 August 2024", "order": 1, "name": "first_online", "label": "First Online", "group": {"name": "ChapterHistory", "label": "Chapter History"}}]}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 8, 10]], "date-time": "2026-08-10T15:31:38Z", "timestamp": 1786375898103, "version": "build-2736575974"}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Instats Inc.", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "abstract": "<jats:p>This workshop covers practical techniques in no-code and and research-focused methods for discovering, extracting, and transforming web-based information into analysis-ready datasets. Participants are not expected to code. Instead, they will work through a guided scraping, data cleaning, validation, and reproducible pipeline containing scripts in both Python and R and a web-accessible application through which they will upload, process, inspect, and export data.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.61700/k4o0reukq0p0g2350", "type": "report", "created": {"date-parts": [[2026, 8, 10]], "date-time": "2026-08-10T15:19:57Z", "timestamp": 1786375197000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["Web Scraping and Data Collection"], "prefix": "10.61700", "author": [{"ORCID": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6157-5647", "authenticated-orcid": false, "given": "Moses", "family": "Boudourides", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "47853", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 8, 10]], "date-time": "2026-08-10T15:19:57Z", "timestamp": 1786375197000}, "score": 48.592186, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://instats.org/seminar/web-scraping-and-data-collection-1"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.61700/k4o0reukq0p0g2350", "published": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2025, 11, 17]], "date-time": "2025-11-17T15:43:09Z", "timestamp": 1763394189563, "version": "3.45.0"}, "posted": {"date-parts": [[2020, 12, 26]]}, "group-title": "Open Science Framework", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Center for Open Science", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[2020, 12, 26]], "date-time": "2020-12-26T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1608940800000}, "content-version": "unspecified", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "abstract": "<p>Web scraping adalah penggunaan sebuah sistem/\u201dbot\u201d yang didesain untuk membantu manusia dalam pengumpulan data tertentu pada tumpukan dokumen digital (yang diakses melalui internet). Terdapat tiga aktivitas utama dalam web scraping: 1) mengakses sumber dokument digital, 2) mengekstrak data tertentu dari dokument melalui set instruksi yang diberikan, 3) menyimpan data kedalam format dan struktur tertentu</p>", "DOI": "10.31219/osf.io/b967h", "type": "posted-content", "created": {"date-parts": [[2020, 12, 26]], "date-time": "2020-12-26T10:36:12Z", "timestamp": 1608978972000